{
  "$comment": "Shared parity fixture for src/lib/allocation.ts and data-pipeline/allocation.py. Inputs and hand-computed expected outputs. When adding cases, verify expected values manually — do not freeze auto-generated numbers, that breaks the parity guarantee. Larger real-state cases will be added in Phase 2 once we have curated baselines.",
  "cases": [
